  skos:prefLabel "arene oxide rearrangement to phenol" ;
  skos:definition "Rearrangement of an arene oxide to a phenol (arenol) by 1,2-migration of hydrogen or a substituent (NIH shift). A rearrangement step, not a subtype of arene oxide formation; related to arene oxide formation as a pathway partner." ;
